{
 "_comment": "tiny-chat E5, the data bar (experiments/tiny_chat_2026-10/PREREGISTRATION.md). 12 pretraining runs of 10000 steps x 16384 tokens (163.84M), each then SFT (1500 steps on human dialogues), two fixed text panels and Carry-5 (post job); one pick per cell. PROVISIONAL learning rates (1e-3): the gate job fails until stage0/lr_choice.json exists and matches; rerun make_jobs.py after Stage 0. Estimated 43 job-hours (17 L4 VM-hours at 2.5x per VM). Home: each PT job's weights (relays + final), each post's summary.json, each pick's best model. Upload vocab_llama3_bpe.gguf with the runner's --upload. Dialogue levels [0, 4, 8, 16]% (copies), E1 at 16% PROVISIONAL (design.json not final: the gate job refuses; rerun make_jobs.py --dialogue-pt-bytes once the whole default human set is measured).",
